{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1348598-moana-as-an-exalted-story","id":1348598,"title":"Moana as an Exalted story","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-14T19:24:56-08:00","id":1348598,"title":"Moana as an Exalted story","content":"No, Moana isn't an Exalt (although you could argue that she's Chosen of whoever the ocean god is); I think it works better as the story of her initiation as a sorcerer.<ul><li>She sacrifices her safe life on Motonui.</li> <li>She undertakes a journey across the great ocean.</li> <li>She finds tutelage from Maui.</li> <li>She learns humility when she admits that she has no idea what she's doing.</li> <li>She overcomes fear when she goes back to face Te Kaa for the second time.</li> </ul><br /> Moana's first act as a full-fledged sorcerer is when she tells the ocean, &quot;Let [Te Kaa] come to me.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1856-hakkonen","name":"Hakkonen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T14:42:01-08:00","id":1348731,"title":"","content":"I think it's a very long and involved story to learn Sorcery, as not every group will have that kind of time to dedicate for it. However, I completely agree with your sentiment. I think there's room for some other Exalted interpretations of that movie too. Maui could be a Lunar Exalt too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T19:09:05-08:00","id":1348771,"title":"","content":"Maui is definitely a very experienced Lunar. Moana strikes me as a freshly Exalted Eclipse. She accomplishes so feats that are definitely athletics charms, and does so similarly crazy stuff with sailing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-16T01:34:30-08:00","id":1348810,"title":"","content":"Moana is the archetypal Eclipse.<br /> <br /> Sailing. Parlay with goddesses and monsters. Dealing with powerful shape-shifters. We see her Beurocracy skills managing the island. Her Socailize knowledge of customs and history. She jumps right in to the world of monsters, on official business, and comes out unharmed (the monsters who try to violate her immunity coming to bad ends).<br /> <br /> Moana Exalts when giving shade to the turtles. The ocean, seeing her cast in the light of Ignatius Divine as she creates her own eclipse, entrusts her with the Heart. (Alternatively, she Exalts when she crosses the reef -- setting out on a world saving journey even though she knows how perilous it will be. It's already established that she lacks the skill to sail beyond the reef but she tries anyway and in a moment of Excellency succeeds with the power of the sun where by rights she should fail.)<br /> <br /> Maui, trickster, warrior, shape-shifter, demi-god of the wind and sea, hero to all, covered in tattoos which describe his legend, banished from the realms of men for an age, is so much a First Age Lunar that it <i>hurts</i>. &quot;Your Welcome&quot; is basically the Lunar theme song.<br /> <br /> It is, as described, an excellent Salinian Initiation into Sorcery. The five steps are beautifully crafted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 11-16-2019, 04:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}